<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX SLIPS SLIGHTLY.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-RIETUMU INDEX SLIPS SLIGHTLY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Rietumu index slipped slightly on Friday by 0.51 percent to 149.65.</p>
<p>The bank also said in a statement that its index fell 0.63 percent since last Friday's close.</p>
<p>-- Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
